[31m-### ✅ Require Pull Request Reviews Before Merging[m
[31m-- **Required approvals**: 2[m
[31m-- **Require review from code owners**: ✅ YES[m
[31m-- **Dismiss stale pull request approvals when new commits are pushed**: ✅ YES[m
[31m-- **Require approval of the most recent reviewable push**: ✅ YES[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Rationale**: Two eyes on every change. Code owners ensure architectural/security alignment. Stale approvals rejected if code changes.[m
[31m-[m
[31m----[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### ✅ Require Status Checks to Pass Before Merging[m
[31m-[m
[31m-All of the following **must pass**:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-#### CI/Quality Gates[m
[31m-- `ci-validate` (lint, format, unit tests)[m
[31m-- Coverage threshold enforced (minimum 80%)[m
[31m-- Any linting errors block merge[m
[31m-[m
[31m-#### Security Gates[m
[31m-- `security/dependency-check` (CVE detection)[m
[31m-- `security/secret-scan` (hardcoded credentials)[m
[31m-- `security/sast` (static analysis)[m
[31m-- `security/container-scan` (Docker image vulnerabilities — if applicable)[m
[31m-[m
[31m-#### Infrastructure Gates (if `.tf` files changed)[m
[31m-- `terraform-validate` (Terraform syntax)[m
[31m-- `terraform-policy` (OPA/Conftest security policies)[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Rationale**: Automated gates catch issues before human review. No exceptions for "we'll fix it later."[m
[31m-[m
[31m----[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### ✅ Require Branches to Be Up to Date Before Merging[m
[31m-- **Require branches to be up to date**: ✅ YES[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Rationale**: Prevent integration issues. All PRs must re-validate against latest main before merge.[m
[31m-[m
[31m----[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### ✅ Require Code Owner Reviews Before Merging[m
[31m-- **Include administrators**: ✅ YES[m
