[31m-- Related: #655[m
[31m-- Related: #622[m
[31m-[m
[31m-## Implementation Notes[m
[31m-- Define an explicit admin-portal-to-code-server control-plane contract for:[m
[31m-  - session issuance and revocation[m
[31m-  - user suspension and recovery[m
[31m-  - repository and workspace entitlement lookup[m
[31m-  - policy bundles for extensions, terminals, environment variables, secrets, and AI features[m
[31m-  - audit/event propagation[m
[31m-- Keep code-server enforcement stateless where possible; any cache should be short-lived, observable, and revocable.[m
[31m-- Prefer one global policy bundle over repo-specific policy forks unless there is a signed exception path.[m
[31m-- Reuse the org-wide auth and policy baseline from `#650` rather than creating a parallel auth model.[m
